A||||3||mblackwell||Dumb Question- pulley removal||||5||
Z||000000||mblackwell||09-16-2001||11:52 PM||||I am trying to take off the pulley that powers the alt and water pump.  Do I need to remove the large cental bolt or just the 4 outer ones?||||reg||5
Z||000001||Steve Normington||09-17-2001||12:54 AM||||You need to remove all five of them. You may need an impact wrench for the big center bolt.||||reg||1
Z||000002||8Ball||09-17-2001||12:56 AM||||I got mine off with a 25" long ratchet and some elbow grease. Wasn't that hard actually.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Wolfhound||09-18-2001||10:59 AM||||You also need a harmonic balancer puller to remove it.||||reg||1
